<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
“ISG control Mode” is parameter of ECM. “Relay 2P Current”, “Relay 3P Current” and “ISG + Terminal Voltage” are parameters of auxiliary power module (lithium-ion battery).
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
*1: In the generating mode, “Relay 2P Current” is displayed in a negative value. Standard current value is sum of “Relay 2P Current” converted into a positive value and “Relay 3P Current”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
